  (text "U17 loads the opcode in FETCH (/LOAD_INSTR) and holds 02h while RUN is low." (at 40 205 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3d9690a6-358e-5f26-adf1-83e70eb7fadf))
  (text "U2's STALL (STALL_IN) goes to the cartridge; STALL_OUT comes back to U1 and the PC." (at 40 209 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1487d6d7-e022-5af9-9f7e-f36d7ee50ead))
  (text "U1 State: FETCH / LOAD / EXEC, register loads (active low, F377 /E), RW (1 = read)." (at 40 213 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6e107f7a-6bf0-5a5c-b6fa-5092600e45ad))
  (text "U2 Branch: NEG is AC7.  ALU_DONE (18) and CARRY (20) are internal registers: no connection." (at 40 217 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3874f2df-9bee-54c1-b86c-b5fcb9aa8411))
  (text "Bring-up straps S1-S3 go in U1's socket (BRINGUP.md), not on the board." (at 40 221 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 19e1faa0-29e8-5146-ae26-6d611ede293c))
